{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-full-no-tool-search-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:00:33.323Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d5ba5d1cd841c030bbf68efc23c9fe3fcdaf620983a076e5ebc0a36cf17b7814","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers in Moss's notes:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at Doors 14–18 in the Eau Claire yard weren't getting their SMS bay assignments at the gatehouse kiosk. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the 04:00 shift on 5 Oct got through without help. A follow-up said to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n2. **#4419**: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 support for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date.\n\nWhat I checked:\n- Moss's other North notes (14 Sep 2025 and 23 Mar 2026) mention QFL but give no ticket numbers.\n- Moss's Central notes list #4409, #4412 and FR-882. Those belong to Central accounts, not QFL.\n- The cheat sheet warns not to mix QFL up with Quarendon Freightways, which isn't our customer.\n- Moss's posts in #general and #help-it-ops: none there.\n\nI only looked at Moss's notes that you can open yourself. Tickets that sit somewhere else, like the CRM, wouldn't show up here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
